    Judge quiet hours at the time the nudge is actually delivered
    
    On the spring-forward night a nudge time that doesn't exist moves forward
    an hour. Quiet hours were checked against the nominal time, so a nudge
    delivered inside quiet hours could be loud (and the reverse).
    
    Fixed under the test lock (NIGHTJAR_LOCK_TESTS=1); the failing test from
    the previous commit now passes. make test: 68 passed, make lint clean.
    
    Refs: S-114 AC3

